                        "glosses": [
                            "Conduite en état d’ivresse (délit de conduite d’un véhicule sous l’effet d’une substance psychotrope)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad962c70-d2b5-3d6d-89a1-3fcae636ee24",
                        "entry_id": "6493e808-3639-35f6-b01a-3e2323ee483f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Communauté des États indépendants."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d98e2301-dd45-49da-be5e-34ea98de86c5",
                                "sense_id": "ad962c70-d2b5-3d6d-89a1-3fcae636ee24",
                                "text": "«Le 15 octobre, sur un terrain d'entraînement du district militaire Ouest, dans la région de Belgorod, deux citoyens originaires d'un pays de la CEI ont commis un attentat», a indiqué le ministère russe de la Défense, en référence à la Communauté des États Indépendants (CEI), une alliance de plusieurs ex-républiques soviétiques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0aaa5129-6693-455a-bedd-b4b3fdf06b04",
                                "sense_id": "ad962c70-d2b5-3d6d-89a1-3fcae636ee24",
                                "text": "La Communauté des États indépendants (CEI) a été créée en décembre 1991 par onze pays de l’ex-URSS"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b2fda7f-4f4a-4c89-a029-3faf3c9b56e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "6493e808-3639-35f6-b01a-3e2323ee483f",
                        "source_sense_id": "2db57476-80a5-3fd1-b445-c2a97d75d038",
                        "source_sense_description": "Conduite en état d’ivresse",
                        "target_lang_word": "DUI",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "DUI",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0f4a9a5-42f5-3925-ae6b-b8ed847f1043",
                                        "entry_id": "b629e8e3-83bd-391a-ae22-3dec48212141",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of driving under the influence [of alcohol or other drugs]: the act of doing so; a charge or conviction for that act."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "initialism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a700f749-357c-4877-b5fe-35259b1580c7",
                                                "sense_id": "e0f4a9a5-42f5-3925-ae6b-b8ed847f1043",
                                                "text": "DUI is punishable by jail time and by fines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74da5ee7-1bea-48fe-a80c-eecf4030153e",
                                                "sense_id": "e0f4a9a5-42f5-3925-ae6b-b8ed847f1043",
                                                "text": "They hit him with DUI and gross negligence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c5fb050-0c84-40f1-9c85-6ab408f95b63",
                                                "sense_id": "e0f4a9a5-42f5-3925-ae6b-b8ed847f1043",
                                                "text": "He has several DUIs on his rap sheet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd3430aa-cda9-4a11-9ea9-4460cecfb21c",
                                                "sense_id": "e0f4a9a5-42f5-3925-ae6b-b8ed847f1043",
                                                "text": "Mr. Kelly acknowledged that alcoholism has been a problem for some air marshals — he said about 13 marshals had gotten D.U.I.s in the last three years — and he said that one marshal in the last five years had committed suicide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8e1b6b6-0284-438e-9257-7c7d06449744",
                                                "sense_id": "e0f4a9a5-42f5-3925-ae6b-b8ed847f1043",
                                                "text": "They can go out and drink without worrying about getting a DUI or killing someone driving home (“I’m much better off in the back of your car, aren’t I?”)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "041dff27-6dcc-4286-8609-566859ca6373",
                                                "sense_id": "e0f4a9a5-42f5-3925-ae6b-b8ed847f1043",
                                                "text": "[see title]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
